Package: TriGer
Type: Package
Title: Structured Cross-Omics Interaction Discovery with a Triple-Graph Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jiaao", "Yu", email = "jy2941@umd.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Detects modules of features that are densely associated across two
    omics layers and coherent within each layer. Dense cross-omics blocks are
    found by greedy peeling of the cross-omics association matrix, and large
    blocks are refined by greedy peeling of the within-omics correlation
    matrices. Plotting functions show the detected modules alongside the
    within-omics correlation structure.
